#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:5
#: 93e79f53fb0e42b3b586310e9169a7e8
msgid "Arming the motors"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:7
#: 3e0479f3f3e14dafaff8c5d36669a09f
msgid "Arming the vehicle allows the motors to start spinning.  Before arming, make sure all people, objects, and any body parts (e.g., hands) are clear of the propellers. Then do the following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:12
#: 2e4d3358fe574fc5bbd258caa6221fb2
msgid "Turn on your transmitter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:13
#: bfbf4d7ca05340d8b19c9227fdbde472
msgid "Plug in the LiPo battery.  The red and blue lights should flash for a few seconds as the gyros are calibrated (do not move the copter)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:14
#: dfb7c8c0afea4916a915390d23e43cc6
msgid "The pre-arm checks will run automatically and if any problems are found the RGB LED will blink yellow and the failure will be displayed on the ground station.  Please refer to :ref:`this page <common-prearm-safety-checks>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:15
#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:57
#: 2d57d9aaa47442009257d7b9934a6186
#: af86ba00ae3e4c67a7a1903a1dcf83a5
msgid "Check that your flight mode switch is set to Stabilize, ACRO, AltHold, Loiter, or PosHold"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:16
#: 77299d800f6644b49260e70c25c001b7
msgid "If using an autopilot with a safety switch, press it until the light goes solid"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:17
#: 73be4c84736a4a12843b7078477b3e8f
msgid "If you are planning on using an autonomous mode (i.e. Loiter, RTL, Auto, etc) switch the vehicle to Loiter or PosHold and wait until the LEDs blink green indicating a good GPS lock"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:18
#: f0480c68c6d54d9785f28f510b2ec928
msgid "Arm the motors by holding the throttle down, and rudder right for 5 seconds.  Do not hold the rudder right for too long (>15 seconds) or you will begin the :ref:`AutoTrim <autotrim>` feature"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:19
#: 61a6e893ed614afca739a2af30755848
msgid "Once armed, the LEDs will go solid and the propellers will begin to spin"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:20
#: 8a36af7cea75481494d0d479153e3b29
msgid "Raise the throttle to take-off"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:24
#: 478de14fb5d543afb78c7705fa5f6cfd
msgid "If you leave the throttle at minimum for 15 seconds while in any of the above modes the motors will automatically disarm."
msgstr ""

