msgid "Copter will allow arming in some modes without a good GPS location being obtained before arming. If you want any of the modes such as RTL, LOITER, etc. to work properly, you should enable the \"Need location\" pre-arm check by setting the :ref:`ARMING_NEED_LOC<ARMING_NEED_LOC>` parameter to \"1\" to be sure you have position information available."
